OL,3,GNEWSANetwork Fail mural mocks
OL,4,Acontroversial rail plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA piece of street art has appeared on
OL,7,Fthe side of a building mocking
OL,8,Fcontroversial proposals to wipe out
OL,9,Fseveral buildings as part of a #1.75bn
OL,10,Fupgrade of the railways.
OL,12,FThe mural, by a mystery artist, shows a
OL,13,Fworker in orange overalls bearing the
OL,14,Fwords Network Fail spreading black
OL,15,Fpaint over an existing artwork on the
OL,16,Fside of The Warehouse in Digbeth,
OL,17,FBirmingham.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
