OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSANetwork Fail mural mocks
OL,4,Acontroversial rail plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe building, home to Friends of the
OL,7,FEarth Birmingham, is earmarked for
OL,8,Fdemolition along with several other
OL,9,Fbusinesses to make way for the
OL,10,Fextension of the Bordesley Viaduct as
OL,11,Fpart of the Midlands Rail Hub project.
OL,13,FChief executive Karen Leach said: "When
OL,14,Fwe saw it at first glance, we thought
OL,15,Fit had been vandalized - it was just a
OL,16,Freal shock and then we realised, that's
OL,17,Fgenius."
